# v0.1.0 — Manual LLM Review PoC

First public proof of concept for Sampled Review Inspector.

## Included

- Single-file browser app (`index.html`)
- No API and no server requirement
- Local `.txt` / `.md` loading
- Beginning / seeded-random / ending sampling
- Configurable sample size
- Reproducible seed and character offsets
- Structured review prompt generation
- Manual JSON review import
- PASS / REVIEW / HOLD / REJECT rendering
- Suggested expansion range for flagged samples
- Example document and example review JSON

## Core idea

> sample → inspect → anomaly → expand

This release intentionally avoids automated AI-authorship claims. AI-writing signals are treated only as a weak review signal.

## Suggested GitHub release title

`v0.1.0 — Manual LLM Review PoC`

## Suggested repository description

`Adaptive document review by sampling first and expanding only when needed.`
